# Editor & OS
# iCloud/Dropbox conflict copies. A sync service drops a `foo 2.webp` beside
# `foo.webp` whenever it sees a write it thinks is contended, and a bare
# `git add -A` sweeps them straight into a commit. The one real asset with a
# number in its name is negated below.
* [0-9].*
*\ [0-9].*
!*Design System 2.webp
